{{define "content" -}}
{{- $e := .Data -}}
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="muted text-sm"><a href="{{playerPath $e.Handle}}">{{$e.Handle}}</a> / Raw events</nav>

<div class="page-head">
  <h1 id="events-title" data-handle="{{$e.Handle}}">{{$e.Handle}}&#8217;s events</h1>
  <p>The log the boards are computed from, newest first. Everything else on catlog is a fold&#8217;s opinion about a history you cannot see; this is the history, which is what makes &#8220;your record is 214&#160;m/s&#8221; checkable rather than merely asserted.</p>
  {{- /* What this log leaves out — flagged flights, the install id, the
         relabelled career and kitten ids — is stated in full on /docs/privacy,
         not restated on both event pages. See docs/DECISIONS.md UI-063. */}}
  <p class="muted"><small>Numbers here are raw, in the unit the event carried &#8212; hover one for how catlog would write it. <a href="/docs/privacy">What this log leaves out</a>.</small></p>
</div>

{{template "events-types" $e}}

{{template "events-panel" $e.Panel}}

{{template "events-pager" $e}}
{{- end}}
